<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply rose 0.4 pct in April.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply rose 0.4 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New</p>
<p>Zealand on Thursday released the following estimated money</p>
<p>supply figures for April.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>M3		    April 1997   Mar 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>mthly change	+0.4 pct     +1.7 pct    +2.3 pct</p>
<p>yr-on-yr change   +8.3 pct     +10.3 pct   +12.8 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>PSC		   April 1997   Mar 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>mthly change	+0.8 pct     +0.7 pct    +1.7 pct</p>
<p>yr-on-yr change   +10.4 pct    +11.3 pct   +15.7 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>M1		    April 1997   Mar 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>mthly change	-3.4 pct     +10.6 pct   -1.3 pct</p>
<p>yr-on-yr change   +5.9 pct     +8.1 pct    +2.0 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
</text>
